# Publish ONLY index.html to GitHub Pages.
# Strategy: ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore the files that are safe to publish.

# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Allow the published page and the ignore rules themselves
!index.html
!.gitignore

# Notes:
# - alaska-2027-planning-journal.md and any other local notes stay untracked and are never pushed.
# - CLAUDE.md is intentionally kept local (not published). Remove the "/*" rule above
#   or add "!CLAUDE.md" if you ever want it committed.
